        {
          "text": "Lino nibakali kukondwa mumyoyo yabo, bantu bamumunzi basizibi bakazyunguluka iŋanda, bauma cijazyo, nkabela bakaambila munene mwiniŋanda kuti, Amulete anze oyo mwaalumi iwakanjila muŋanda yako, kuti tumuzibe, ",
