        {
          "text": "Amubone! Mwanaangu musimbi nakalindu nkwali, alimwi simamambe wakwe nkwali. Amuleke, mbalete anze, Amubalalike akubacitila kufumbwa ncimuyanda, pele oyu mwaalumi mutamucitili cintu cibi cili boobu pe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
