                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo bantu bakakaka kumvwa, Elyo mwiniŋanda wakajata simamambe wakwe, wamutonta anze kulimbabo, nkabela bakamulalika ukumubisizya masiku oonse mane bwakaca. Lino nibwakatalika kuca, bakamuleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
